<?tyhpdef
/**
 * Hand-written Layer 1 for odbc.
 * Managed PHP does not provision `odbc` (TYHP7511); signatures follow
 * PHP 8.2-8.5 docs. PHP 8.4 replaced `resource` handles with
 * `Odbc\Connection` / `Odbc\Result` objects across this extension
 * (see php.net "Resource to Object" migration notes), so connection- and
 * statement-typed signatures are version-gated: `resource` below PHP 8.4,
 * the new object types from PHP 8.4 on.
 *
 * @link https://www.php.net/manual/en/book.uodbc.php
 */
